New central world state system:
[x] Create a world state class to store basic data about dynamic objects (test the system)
[x] Make syncronisation of changes in the state automatic (client never writes state but sends commands)
[x] Corridor doors do not sync with the outer doors of other modules
[ ] Merge spatial index and state
[ ] State changes marks that object dirty and calls a callback from the state (subscribe to state updates/replace EventSystem for state changes)
[ ] Put all space objects and their contents into state (decouple state from logic)
[ ] Gradually remove objects, so state is only source of truth for game data
[ ] Remove all stats and details messages and put into StatsUpdateMessage/StatsUpdateRequest.
[ ] Serve state as parameter instead of as a variable
[ ] Rewrite trigger executors to use state
[ ] Split World.cs and Server.cs into correct classes
[ ] Make saving simply writing and reading stored state on disk (server)
[ ] Remove pivots
[ ] Queue state update messages when loading, and apply after loading is done
[ ] Fix ship driving without power and engine
[ ] Move collections of all space objects into SolarSystem.cs on the server and only allow access trough getters and setters
[ ] Fix refused state request echoing back same request instead of sending actual state or error
[ ] Make OrbitParameters and common math into a library and use state to keep ingame orbits in sync

